* Add flag and do the rough skeleton of the feature

* Swiftlint

* Use the concrete OhttpManager from A-S

* Update Glean package

* Update following comments + use real Glean objects

* Uncomment code

* Typo + comments

* Fix feature flag check

* Make adjustments to support http capability as well

* Use URLSessionProtocol

* Adjust for unit tests

* Invert capable request checks

* Add tests for ohttp uploader

* Add http uploader tests

* Create protocol to share build request function

* Adjust logs + unused variable url
